{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16713865708311965167,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Cast Engine",
      "source_hash": 11922119697014891534,
      "context_hash": 2449343805759739018,
      "translation": "Cast Engine",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Cast Engine": "Cast Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313402Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Cast Engine narrows `f32`/`i32` pipeline results to lower-precision types (e.g., `bf16`) before the [Commit Engine](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md) writes them to DM, reducing storage cost.",
      "source_hash": 6358378300505858586,
      "context_hash": 7860247146068738673,
      "translation": "Cast Engine은 [Commit Engine](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md)이 `f32`/`i32` 파이프라인 결과를 DM에 쓰기 전에 이를 더 낮은 정밀도 타입(예: `bf16`)으로 좁혀 저장 비용을 줄입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DM": "DM",
        "Commit Engine": "Commit Engine",
        "Cast Engine": "Cast Engine",
        "pipeline": "파이프라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313404Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Interface",
      "source_hash": 7655632546613034002,
      "context_hash": 3071574758968890827,
      "translation": "인터페이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`CollectTensor`, `ContractTensor`, and `VectorFinalTensor` all expose `.cast()` with the same semantics.",
      "source_hash": 5713162077691910314,
      "context_hash": 13547557540447891878,
      "translation": "`CollectTensor`, `ContractTensor`, `VectorFinalTensor`는 모두 동일한 의미의 `.cast()`를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`.cast::<OutD, OutPacket>()` converts each element to type `OutD` and pads the output back to one 32-byte flit.",
      "source_hash": 14677500921358940068,
      "context_hash": 13206426486671412622,
      "translation": "`.cast::<OutD, OutPacket>()`는 각 요소를 `OutD` 타입으로 변환하고 출력을 다시 32바이트 flit 하나에 맞게 패딩합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "element": "요소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel writer chooses `OutD` (the target type) and `OutPacket` (the output element layout).",
      "source_hash": 12140645658401156974,
      "context_hash": 879574449855813478,
      "translation": "커널 작성자는 `OutD`(대상 타입)와 `OutPacket`(출력 요소 레이아웃)을 선택합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "element": "요소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The compiler derives the rest.",
      "source_hash": 5934499045022896062,
      "context_hash": 4512567061701324830,
      "translation": "나머지는 컴파일러가 도출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Although the Cast Engine is not a [mathematical tensor move](../mapping-tensors/tensor-semantics.md#mathematical-tensor-move), it preserves the tensor's shape and only changes the element type.",
      "source_hash": 18166354300121926823,
      "context_hash": 9740815834649466567,
      "translation": "Cast Engine은 [수학적 텐서 이동](../mapping-tensors/tensor-semantics.md#mathematical-tensor-move)은 아니지만, 텐서의 형태를 보존하고 요소 타입만 변경합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "element": "요소",
        "Cast Engine": "Cast Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "All dimensions pass through unchanged, except for the `Packet` layout, which repads so the output still fits one 32-byte flit.",
      "source_hash": 7441924698642441616,
      "context_hash": 1627563759246576457,
      "translation": "모든 차원은 변경 없이 그대로 통과하지만, `Packet` 레이아웃만은 예외로 출력이 여전히 32바이트 flit 하나에 맞도록 다시 패딩됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The example below casts an 8-element `i32` packet (8 × 4 = 32 bytes) to `i8`.",
      "source_hash": 11946972416420696264,
      "context_hash": 17142255661102693573,
      "translation": "아래 예제는 8개 요소로 이루어진 `i32` 패킷(8 × 4 = 32바이트)을 `i8`로 캐스팅합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "element": "요소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "After the cast, the 8 elements occupy 8 bytes, so `A # 32` pads the output back to 32 bytes:",
      "source_hash": 12541448715106630359,
      "context_hash": 6276149442860107941,
      "translation": "캐스팅 후 8개 요소는 8바이트를 차지하므로, `A # 32`가 출력을 다시 32바이트로 패딩합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "elements": "요소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The input data may not fill 32 bytes.",
      "source_hash": 4208341583307845947,
      "context_hash": 16427721454409221922,
      "translation": "입력 데이터가 32바이트를 모두 채우지 않을 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "The example below casts an `i32` input where 4 data elements are padded to 8 (`A # 8`, 32 bytes) into an `i8` output where the same 4 elements are padded to 32 (`A # 32`, also 32 bytes):",
      "source_hash": 13883006289574593374,
      "context_hash": 15986086244266393496,
      "translation": "아래 예제는 4개의 데이터 요소가 8로 패딩된(`A # 8`, 32바이트) `i32` 입력을, 동일한 4개 요소가 32로 패딩된(`A # 32`, 역시 32바이트) `i8` 출력으로 캐스팅합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "elements": "요소",
        "padded": "패딩"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported Casts",
      "source_hash": 11832902117767257664,
      "context_hash": 1978941341616146638,
      "translation": "지원되는 캐스팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each input is a 32-byte flit.",
      "source_hash": 10262697998717185385,
      "context_hash": 11236874688448010773,
      "translation": "각 입력은 32바이트 flit 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The supported source types are `f32` and `i32`, each with specific target types:",
      "source_hash": 5230595409563592460,
      "context_hash": 8317624974322740266,
      "translation": "지원되는 원본 타입은 `f32`와 `i32`이며, 각각 지원하는 대상 타입이 정해져 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Input Type (`D`)",
      "source_hash": 791363949065430282,
      "context_hash": 622349790505878909,
      "translation": "입력 타입(`D`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Supported Output Types (`OutD`)",
      "source_hash": 17992148057746103013,
      "context_hash": 11281008812399875218,
      "translation": "지원되는 출력 타입(`OutD`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`i32`",
      "source_hash": 8982438720138546349,
      "context_hash": 1932321303800014591,
      "translation": "`i32`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`i4`, `i8`, `i16`",
      "source_hash": 18200396313378179697,
      "context_hash": 17923880244326949104,
      "translation": "`i4`, `i8`, `i16`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`f32`",
      "source_hash": 4174491082088422260,
      "context_hash": 15122232165341589549,
      "translation": "`f32`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`f8e5m2`, `f8e4m3`, `bf16`",
      "source_hash": 15232975435232879023,
      "context_hash": 1663789869167017347,
      "translation": "`f8e5m2`, `f8e4m3`, `bf16`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance",
      "source_hash": 1168761202931664327,
      "context_hash": 8882974816236538990,
      "translation": "성능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "performance": "성능"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Cast Engine is never the pipeline bottleneck: it processes one flit per cycle regardless of how much of the flit carries valid data.",
      "source_hash": 10441349908972870919,
      "context_hash": 9850847068701986978,
      "translation": "Cast Engine은 결코 파이프라인의 병목이 되지 않습니다. flit 중 유효한 데이터가 얼마나 담겨 있는지와 관계없이 사이클당 flit 하나를 처리하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pipeline": "파이프라인",
        "Cast Engine": "Cast Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The downstream [Commit Engine](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md) aggregates under-utilized flits into dense DM writes, so no DM bandwidth is wasted.",
      "source_hash": 5126435273109751074,
      "context_hash": 15231814919440353324,
      "translation": "다운스트림의 [Commit Engine](../moving-tensors/commit-engine.md)이 충분히 활용되지 않은 flit들을 모아 조밀한 DM 쓰기로 만들므로, DM 대역폭이 낭비되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Commit Engine": "Commit Engine",
        "DM": "DM"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:49.313407Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}